# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Lixin Fang et al. (2026). Transfer Learning from Homogeneous to Heterogeneous: Fine-Tuning a Pretrained Interatomic Potential for Multicomponent Mo Alloys with Localized Substitutional Alloying.
#   Materials. doi:10.3390/ma19091715
#
# Version read: publisher (sha256 587f5a2197ec03aa...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 433 (Training/reliability). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/fang2026.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the DFT (PBE, spin-polarised) data of dilute single-
# and double-site substituted BCC (128 atoms) and FCC (108 atoms) Mo with
# 11 dopants (FT-E: 420 near-equilibrium structures; FT-E_NE: 6,970
# including relaxation frames), MACE models at small, medium and large
# scale in zero-shot, scratch and fine-tuned settings, and the mean test
# MAEs and RMSEs of Table 1 (IID splits) and the per-element
# leave-one-dopant-out test errors of the medium fine-tuned FT-E model
# (Table 2, strict and relaxed protocols).

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix mls: <http://www.w3.org/ns/mls#> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix mlips: <https://w3id.org/mlips#> .
@prefix entity: <https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/> .

###############################################################################
# Q1 -- Bibliographic identification
###############################################################################

entity:study-fang2026 a mlips:BenchmarkStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Fang et al. (2026): fine-tuning MACE-MP-0 from homogeneous crystals to dilute multicomponent Mo alloys (zero-shot, scratch and fine-tuned models)" ;
    mlips:reportedIn entity:article-fang2026 .

